 pace </strong>from infantry combat.<strong> </strong>Experience the battlefield from the<strong> perspective of a tank commander - </strong>sharpen your senses to survive <strong>intense armored battles</strong> in challenging conditions and unforgiving swamps and lowlands of the Dutch countryside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/4637279960dd5b5edee7d0404c3aea82.poster.avif?t=1753563776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/4637279960dd5b5edee7d0404c3aea82.webm?t=1753563776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/4637279960dd5b5edee7d0404c3aea82.mp4?t=1753563776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/Not_a_Game_-_Tribute.png?t=1753563776\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udfe8\u00a0 STYLIZED GRAPHICS - TRIBUTE TO LONG GONE ERA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a <strong>love letter to the PlayStation 2 era - golden era of WWII games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unforgettable WWII games that shaped a generation of players, delivering gripping stories, intense battles, and immersive campaigns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It was a time when war stories were told with<strong> heart, authenticity, passion, and deep respect for history -\u00a0 <u>and we are on the mission to bring this back.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With <strong>stylized visuals</strong> designed to capture the <strong>warmth and charm of that time</strong>, we blend <strong>nostalgia</strong> with <strong>refined gameplay</strong> to <strong>bring back the magic of a long gone era</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This isn\u2019t just a game. It\u2019s a tribute.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/eb4ec19303166c93d63acd85c0fdebde.poster.avif?t=1753563776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/eb4ec19303166c93d63acd85c0fdebde.webm?t=1753563776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/eb4ec19303166c93d63acd85c0fdebde.mp4?t=1753563776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/A_BRIDGE_TOO_FAR.png?t=1753563776\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udfe8\u00a0 WELCOME TO ARNHEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step onto the blood-soaked streets of <strong>Arnhem</strong> and relive one of the most intense battles of <strong>World War II</strong>. The <strong>city has been faithfully recreated</strong> to capture the atmosphere and chaos of this historic battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/6e9fe724ada56396249deddd7ac64c43.poster.avif?t=1753563776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/6e9fe724ada56396249deddd7ac64c43.webm?t=1753563776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/6e9fe724ada56396249deddd7ac64c43.mp4?t=1753563776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udfe8 AND MANY MORE ....</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> From war-torn cities to the vast countryside of the Netherlands, we bring iconic locations to life with authenticity and respect. Inspired by both real history and the unforgettable depictions in classic war films, every environment immerses you in the <strong>authentic atmosphere of World War II.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/Strong_Divider.png?t=1753563776\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/SEE_YOU_ON_THE_BATTLEFIELD_solo.png?t=1753563776\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/0d81331d3e5163b0f02808b932a42bbc.poster.avif?t=1753563776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/0d81331d3e5163b0f02808b932a42bbc.webm?t=1753563776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/0d81331d3e5163b0f02808b932a42bbc.mp4?t=1753563776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","developers":["Icy Bayts"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/92dbfc6a8a0f7f059df86